{"cost_usd": 0.146294, "explanation": {"found": "LOCATED fix40 (code) by findings [0]"}, "grade": {"chance": 0.0408, "findings": 1.0, "found": 1.0, "found_code": 1.0}, "in_tokens": 58237, "latency_s": 29.954, "meta": {"dropped_by_guardrails": 0, "findings_detail": [{"description": "In the Staging1 branch, the first packet of any opcode arms the ciphers, sends SMSG_RESUME_COMMS and promotes the socket to stream 1. The check for `opcode == CMSG_AUTH_CONTINUED_SESSION` only comes after promotion, and neither the 36-byte payload length, the connect-to key nor the SHA-1 digest is verified. The only credential is the peer IP matching a ticket, so another host behind the same NAT that connects to the stream-1 port first can take the session's second stream. That stream carries the stream-1 gated traffic (combat, loot, duel). A non-0x044D first packet also arms the cipher after the fact, which just corrupts framing.", "file": "src/proto/ClientConnection.cpp", "fix_sketch": "Require opcode == CMSG_AUTH_CONTINUED_SESSION with the expected payload size before arming and promoting, and ideally verify the echoed connect-to key (and digest) against the ticket; drop the peer otherwise.", "kind": "security", "line": 404, "severity": "medium"}], "per_bug": [{"bug": "fix40", "chance": 0.0408, "hits": [0], "in_review": true, "located": true, "visible": "code"}], "prompt_chars": 134436, "route_reasons": [], "routed_model": null, "tier": null, "unreviewed_files": [], "usage_calls": [{"completion_tokens": 2798, "completion_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 2425}, "cost": 0.14174, "cost_details": {"upstream_inference_completions_cost": 0.02798, "upstream_inference_cost": 0.14174, "upstream_inference_prompt_cost": 0.11376}, "is_byok": false, "prompt_tokens": 56880, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0, "video_tokens": 0}, "total_tokens": 59678}, {"completion_tokens": 184, "completion_tokens_detail